    "turn_text": "Do you feel, I mean, perception is reality. And I mean, I am very worried, I mean, switching against to the impeachment question would really worries me. And I say this as somebody obviously who's an outspoken critic of Donald Trump and does not have any sympathy at all for people. I worry that we're gonna be entering an era where The other parts side, one side is always trying to indict the other side. One side is always trying to impeach the other side. Whoever holds the reins of power at the moment is going to try to investigate and impeach the other side. I feel like that's a Rubicon we have crossed. into a new era of politics. And Kelly, it terrifies me. And I don't know, the only thing to stop, the only way to stop it is for one side to just say, listen, we're just not gonna do it. Like we keep escalating, we're just not gonna do it anymore. But we've got another impeachment into Joe Biden, but does that worry you at all? Well,",
