  {
    "episode_id": 47112,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/7/47112.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 32,
    "turn_text": "You know, one of the things that's bothering me, because I mean, I think when you look at the Hunter Biden thing, it's not, I think some people, particularly on the left, have tried to characterize it as well. They're just trying to embarrass Joe Biden by shining a spotlight on The honestly, it's on really terrible behavior of his son. And I agree, if it was just that, it's not fair, but there are real problems here. I mean, there's the fact that... Hunter Biden repeatedly used his father to make money. I mean, we have Hunter Biden's business partner who testified under oath of Congress that he put his father on speakerphone like dozens of times with people. So those are real things worth exploring. But what",
