  {
    "episode_id": 47112,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/7/47112.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 49,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, and Kelly, I would say from my perspective, I think Rob's point about the left saying, don't investigate their guy, but not ours. I'm not one of those people. I think that we should be investigating these things and looking into them. I worry that when the investigation is done by Congress and becomes partisan, I understand you would suggest that the DOJ as partisan, I'm not there yet.",
