    "turn_idx": 75,
    "turn_text": "I mean, you should score. I co-sponsored more bills with Democrats than any other member of the state Senate. You should. I don't know how everybody else does that, Rob. I'm just going to tell you. Sure. I spent enough time on criminal justice reform. I fight with Jamie Raskin as much as any other member of Congress. I'm still going to co-sponsor civil asset forfeiture with him. And if somebody's going to score me bad because him and I agree on that issue. Wait till you see the coalition that comes together on Pfizer reform. Not a lot of issues that me and AOC agree on. We agree on FISA reform. And I don't care. I simply don't. If somebody and I agree on policy that I think is a policy that is good policy to move some of these things forward, I am going to work with them on that. And I don't care if they're a Democrat or a Republican or a liberal or a conservative. And I'm not going to, I don't know what else to tell you other than that's how I approach it. And I wish more people did.",
