    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/7/47112.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 77,
    "turn_text": "Yeah. Yes. I mean, if it comes, it comes. I expect a primary every two years. I expect a tough general every two years. I don't think anybody's entitled to this job. And I think if the argument is simply he, he cosponsored 27 bills with Democrats. So I'm going to primary him. Okay.",
