    "turn_text": "I mean, I've always like the debates over the separation of church and state. Now, I believe in the separation of church and state in so far as I don't want, and I'm not a religious person at all, I don't want the state to have an official religion. I don't want to have like one religion elevated among all others. But I also don't think that religion should be out of the schools or out of the public square. I think you invite them all in.",
